---
import '../styles/about.css';
---

<section id="about" class="about-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
          I'm a full stack developer who thinks carefully about what software is actually <em>for</em>.
          My background spans frontend and backend engineering — Vue, Astro, Node, Python, AWS — but the
          thread running through all of it is a genuine interest in how technology shapes the people who
          use it.
        </p>
        <p>
          That interest led me to publish writing on AI ethics in <em>Becoming Human</em> magazine and to
          pursue philosophy alongside my engineering work. I believe the best developers aren't just
          technically sharp — they ask harder questions about systems, incentives, and consequences.
        </p>
        <p>
          Day to day I integrate AI tools deeply into my workflow — from code generation to research to
          documentation — while keeping a critical eye on where automation helps and where human judgement
          is irreplaceable. That balance is what I bring to every project I work on.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">5+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Years Experience</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">10+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Projects Shipped</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">2</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Published Articles</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
